Support @trusted { ... } and @system { ... } block syntax

`@trusted { STATEMENTS... }` and `@system { STATEMENTS... }` are now supported as shorthand for `() @trusted { STATEMENTS... }();` and `() @system { STATEMENTS... }();` in statement and expression contexts.
-------
void foo() @safe
{
    int x = 0;
    @trusted {
		int* p = &x;
		int* q = p + 1;
		*(q - 1) = 42;
    }
    assert(x == 42);
}
-------
